%H A046026 Charles Ashbacher, <a href="https://fs.unm.edu/SNJ/ANoteOnTheSmarandacheNear.pdf">A Note on the Smarandache Near-To-Primorial Function</a>, Smarandache Notions J. 7 (1996), 46-49.
